Examples:

<INDENT:2>
<INDENT:4>
<BLANK_LINE>
<BLANK_LINES:4>
<PAGE_BREAK>
<MARGIN:WIDE>
<PAUSE:BEAT>
<SCENE_GAP>
<TIMESKIP>

